'''Tsubasa''' (Japanese: '''ツバサ''' ''Tsubasa'') is a young boy in the {{pkmn|manga}} series [[How I Became a Pokémon Card]]. He lives in a small village which holds a contest to determine which villager will be known as the "Air Master", or the ultimate Trainer of bird {{OBP|Pokémon|species}}. Tsubasa wants to become an Air Master, but has no Pokémon of his own, so he attempts to train his grandfather's {{p|Pidgeot}}, which does not take to him. He competes against [[Takaya]] and his {{p|Fearow}}.

